  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Nutrition-sensitive Climate Change A</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to contribute to long term adaptation to and mitigation of climate change impacts by vulnerable populations in Sierra Leone. The principal objective is to strengthen the resilience and improve the food and nutrition security of vulnerable households, especially women and girls, by promoting climate-smart and nutrition-sensitive agriculture that supports dietary diversity coupled with improved access to WASH, health and nutrition services and sustainable household energy solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
